<%- include('partials/header') %>
<div class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Interface guide</p><h1>Shared design system</h1><p class="lead">A working preview of reusable controls for Sherubtse TripHub. This page is for project development, not a booking service.</p></div>
<section class="section-block"><h2>Buttons and feedback</h2><div class="button-row"><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-toast="Your action was noted in this demo.">Show toast</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-dialog-open="demo-dialog">Open dialog</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" disabled>Unavailable action</button></div></section>
<section class="section-block"><h2>Status labels</h2><div class="button-row"><span class="status-badge badge-success">Approved</span><span class="status-badge badge-warning">Pending DSA</span><span class="status-badge badge-danger">Rejected</span><span class="status-badge badge-info">In review</span><span class="status-badge badge-neutral">Draft</span></div></section>
<section class="section-block"><h2>Form example</h2><form class="surface-card demo-form" data-demo-form><div class="form-grid"><label>Trip title <input name="tripTitle" placeholder="e.g. Eastern Bhutan nature trip" required></label><label>Preferred month <select name="month"><option value="">Select month</option><option>March</option><option>April</option><option>May</option></select></label></div><label>Additional note <textarea name="note" rows="3" placeholder="This form is only a design demo"></textarea></label><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Preview form feedback</button></form></section>
<section class="section-block grid-two"><div class="surface-card"><h2>Loading state</h2><div class="loading-inline" role="status"><span class="spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Preparing information…</span></div><p class="small-muted">Illustrative state for operations that take time.</p></div><div class="empty-state"><span class="empty-icon" aria-hidden="true">◌</span><h2>Nothing here yet</h2><p>Records will appear once an approved trip is available.</p></div></section>
<section class="section-block"><h2>Message styles</h2><div class="alert alert-info" role="status">Information: The trip proposal workflow is introduced in a later step.</div><div class="alert alert-warning" role="status">Reminder: A signed form is not automatically an approved trip.</div><div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert">Error example: Please correct highlighted information before submitting.</div></section>
<dialog id="demo-dialog" class="app-dialog" aria-labelledby="demo-dialog-title"><div class="dialog-content"><h2 id="demo-dialog-title">Example confirmation</h2><p>This is a functioning dialog pattern. It does not modify any trip records.</p><form method="dialog" class="button-row"><button class="btn btn-outline">Close</button><button class="btn btn-primary" value="confirm">Confirm demo</button></form></div></dialog>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
